size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;推迟清算&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;托德·伍迪&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;美国政府周五发布了一项&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/U599bLPaz6eQi7b6kLcVnOtfRDH_SGYYM2O1lNWanC4GPCcR8hTlWYOV8JuIk23oJ66JOkxSBsZjGgd0YIItMjfwQT2iCWdfRwwLDyvcPhyWAA17RuGdArZJ2RNqLdP9HGavQT6V5Rei-3DZOC1qHTfZAZNbV7K--Isf7VRmy-AcQUf0kHe7l1TUdOU-4HwxWSbhuFlWdaD3jHC9_TvIQWZvGkOKeui9_ZEbM-24fruAdzp6hh09UYNW63LK2Bf41UHc62E9iKx3d1so53mV7Qjnrh-NBFcwP1J85WOUs67k-0LfZIKGoMT6gKRuMFdpvGruyZh5EdN9EyhGcd1jsaNx/YeYfyHOoYCsPaKPK1Li36M7R383eghW8/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank"&gt;计划&lt;/a&gt;，暂时避免亚利桑那州、加利福尼亚州和内华达州的供水出现灾难性削减，因为&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/uljLuo-VRb0RHtqpVwnZB_G6qZcwlate_xp5mbqkYf7ZfpU2ImbKO4guIR08jznMLJ0Xxkk4sFCT8k7yBE6yKMCEqzV2h1927TJ8Bw40nOHyVTLWN_EJSFgiElZEF82inKRfZxXAQYeKzpw5cACl0ogvjGVjiEeC9w-bSI7slhT22Ou6qWg1pRhVBMG7MVQ2BMNcMjIcxXtHEx8hQ8LwqTd13n-mPOy-g1qwOkOLaDPpa-p2KTd9Nca_hqSylDnvXCgKMnoTJyBL4BMETH1lpY3z8VThAGEgoj6_Cgcbpxjp6PXxZlu_9Ytvl7HJL0Ld5WuTcOR-qkXevsoLcYjWcCXV8J5816LgUgBjLoygsgu4NBSMCupsCWNJqT2NUlJfevGDLISdDpWZr7yZALDqgTNx2cw1rFY2vIoR4wf0v8C-qjgS0EYmLAduBUKcCFef-z5yPmQRGCdL7ytLC472RvKfNMpDbAYif11l1gOfhUc3a7D-niKSqkiHtv5N7xb7wuahAEoIIXn4J5HV4vNFH735/YsYRfG57kAVxHQZau97_kJxUDWpO9n3_/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank"&gt;科罗拉多河气候危机&lt;/a&gt;导致水库水位创历史新低，威胁到支持 4000 万人的资源和超过 1 万亿美元的国内生产总值。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;联邦政府将在10月之前确定未来两年水分配的具体削减规模，但其计划是基于受影响州的&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/YsfO5mcAacsUbnxTjpe-upBe0miOSwNImw5w4FbafAiNyN9ST6rUG9SpDGbIC5IUONdciwbrVPetBxYOcJg2QsAzkmV1QPhPgcanBg5LD0WNL-U3HFwVULoGVao7BIQzx-gx6w_Et6DE7zp03VnXErqragLZaM9oESeyKwUHUgQJTul2yWqwZfTg2HIHZ6efYb5YWo3phx9lfx6g-1D3c64DMCC9hwdIYQThzfRfBUERd_Lkg8k